{
  "id": 9,
  "title": "一家人 一个梦 一起拼 一定赢——古河云科技毕棚沟&鹧鸪山团建活动",
  "date": "2022-02-15",
  "summary": "2022年2月11日，春节假期刚结束，公司便为全体员工精心准备了以“一家人 一个梦 一起拼 一定赢”为主题的毕棚沟&鹧鸪山三天兩夜团建活动。",
  "abstract": null,
  "category": "公司动态",
  "href": "/information/detail-9.html",
  "image": "https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-2-15/20222151640331035.jpg",
  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\">2022年2月11日，春节假期刚结束，公司便为全体员工精心准备了以“一家人 一个梦 一起拼 一定赢”为主题的毕棚沟&amp;鹧鸪山三天兩夜团建活动。</span><br /></p><p><span style=\"color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-2-15/20222151655349878.png\" title=\"623fa31e94f20411af1465aa37fe6cc\" alt=\"623fa31e94f20411af1465aa37fe6cc\" /><br /><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\">活动旨在为不同部门之间的同事创造更多沟通机会、增进彼此之间的信任和默契，为之后的团队协作打下一个坚实的基础，同时让全员放松身心、释放压力、调整工作状态，提高团队士气，为今后的工作充电赋能。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-2-15/2022215165678958.png\" title=\"5aa82c4672ba09acaec0973a49d24ce\" alt=\"5aa82c4672ba09acaec0973a49d24ce\" /><br /></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\">此次团建活动准备了丰富多样的项目，不仅有体力挑战项目跳绳与平板支撑，还有智力、创意比拼项目，最后的集体项目“激情节拍”更是将团建活动氛围推向高点，每个人都感受到了强烈的集体荣誉感。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-2-15/20222151656337275.png\" title=\"96e6c6ee860cf67f6b5d7c867fe4db2\" alt=\"96e6c6ee860cf67f6b5d7c867fe4db2\" /><br /><br /></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\">晚上的篝火晚会彭总手握火把，点燃象征古河云希望之光的熊熊篝火，并宣布篝火晚会正式开始。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-2-15/20222151656523128.png\" title=\"004b2e057d342b91a51f4e381a77629\" alt=\"004b2e057d342b91a51f4e381a77629\" /><br /><br /></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\">整场晚会持续近两个小时，期间大家围成一圈参与各种团队游戏，队员们在游戏过程中，充分享受了团队合作的乐趣，最后全体同事在欢声笑语中意犹未尽地结束了整场晚会。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-2-15/20222151657483962.png\" title=\"3e328200a420a80bbb4be124b70e194\" alt=\"3e328200a420a80bbb4be124b70e194\" /><br /><br /></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"></span></p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\">公司为了庆祝北京冬奥会的成功举办，特意来到鹧鸪山景区<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\">体验</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\">刺激的滑雪项目，</span>让大家也<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\">充分感受了冰雪运动带来的挑战与乐趣。</span></span></p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\">在滑雪的过程中免不了跌跌撞撞，但是大家都没有放弃，不畏困难，积极挑战自我，我们需要更加坚强的意志和永不言败的决心，这就是冰雪运动带给我们的鼓舞。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-2-15/2022215165889016.png\" title=\"ec2d82e7650dba0dc74721676925b69\" alt=\"ec2d82e7650dba0dc74721676925b69\" /><br /><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-2-15/20222151658284902.png\" title=\"097cd7478aef3c659eea0545856665d\" alt=\"097cd7478aef3c659eea0545856665d\" /><br /><br /><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-2-15/20222151658491749.png\" title=\"06f87e8d09d873d28091cc5f31b4848\" alt=\"06f87e8d09d873d28091cc5f31b4848\" /><br /><br /></p><p><span style=\"color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\">体验完紧张刺激的滑雪之后，我们来到了风景迷人的毕棚沟景区，冬季的毕棚沟银装素裹，雪山层峦叠嶂，俨然一片冰雪秘境，不失为赏雪景，放松身心的绝佳去处。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-2-15/20222151659398995.png\" title=\"710c5aef5e1943cb63fe81c2583d5c2\" alt=\"710c5aef5e1943cb63fe81c2583d5c2\" /><br /><br /><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-2-15/20222151659405835.png\" title=\"af9f1652183269ba6bb5159ab2fa8de\" alt=\"af9f1652183269ba6bb5159ab2fa8de\" /><br /><br /></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"></span></p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">此次团建活动的成功开展，体现了公司关心员工，把员工当家人的企业文化，加深了员工之间的团结与沟通，也展现出全体员工朝气蓬勃的青春活力与风采，收获了积极向上的正能量。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">企业是树，文化是根，根深才能叶茂。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;color:#333333;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">2022年工作已经开启，希望通过这次团建活动让每一位古河云人都能更好地投入到接下来的工作当中，一起为年度目标奋力拼搏。</p><p><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-2-15/202221517028053.jpg\" title=\"微信图片_20220215165246\" alt=\"微信图片_20220215165246\" /><br /><br /><br /></p>",
